Package: contextd
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Shane Fagan <mail@shanefagan.com>
Depends: systemd, portablectl
Description: Lightweight game and hardware context daemon (Portable Hybrid)
 A generic, lightweight Linux daemon that exposes process context and 
 hardware inventory. Packaged as a systemd portable service.
